# Generated outputs — never commit. Rebuild with scripts/build_labels.py,
# scripts/build_cache.py, and the training/evaluation scripts.
# artifacts_*/ covers alternate preprocessing builds, which keep their own
# manifest and previews so they cannot overwrite each other's provenance.
artifacts/
artifacts_*/
*.log

# Datasets are external and live outside the repo; roots come from config or
# <NAME>_ROOT env vars. These patterns are a backstop for the case where someone
# unpacks a cohort inside the working tree by accident -- a single CBCT volume is
# tens of megabytes and there is no recovering a repo that has swallowed one.
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.dcm
*.mha
*.nrrd

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Tooling
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Packaging
*.tar.gz

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
